<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:ns1="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Nggunakake Basa Aljabar</title>
<metadata>
  <ns1:content-id>m81268</ns1:content-id>
  <ns1:title>Nggunakake Basa Aljabar</ns1:title>
  <ns1:abstract><para id="para-00001">Sawise ngrampungake bagean iki, sampeyan bakal bisa:</para>
<list id="list-00001">
<item>Nggunakake variabel lan simbol aljabar</item>
<item>Ngenali ekspresi lan persamaan</item>
<item>Nggawe ekspresi mawa eksponen luwih prasaja</item>
<item>Nggawe ekspresi luwih prasaja nganggo urutan operasi</item>
</list></ns1:abstract>
  <ns1:uuid>c99ce701-d3cb-4b3d-9864-8a4861034a81</ns1:uuid>
</metadata>

<content>
<note id="fs-id2669644" class="be-prepared">
<para id="fs-id2849855">Sadurunge miwiti, garapen kuis kesiapan iki.</para>
<exercise id="fs-idm203962224">
<problem id="fs-idm202994368">
<para id="fs-idm203085696"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>Gunggungen:</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>43</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>69</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math><newline />Yen wangsulan sampeyan kanggo soal iki salah, sinaunen maneh <link target-id="fs-id1348056" document="m81244" />.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm208175728">
<para id="fs-idm213977600"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>112</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id2669643" class="be-prepared">
<exercise id="fs-idm213983120">
<problem id="fs-idm220642480">
<para id="fs-idm212324528"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>Pingna:</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>896</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>201</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math><newline />Yen wangsulan sampeyan kanggo soal iki salah, sinaunen maneh <link target-id="fs-id2218296" document="m81255" />.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm216259264">
<para id="fs-idm217087024"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>180</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>096</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id1339365" class="be-prepared">
<exercise id="fs-idm214465168">
<problem id="fs-idm214875296">
<para id="fs-idm216311584"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>Paranen:</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>7,263</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math><newline />Yen wangsulan sampeyan kanggo soal iki salah, sinaunen maneh <link target-id="fs-id2597529" document="m81256" />.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm220771872">
<para id="fs-idm214785696"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>807</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<section id="fs-id1618903"><title>Nggunakake Variabel lan Simbol Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id2425891">Greg lan Alex ulang taun ing tanggal sing padha, nanging lair ing taun sing beda. Taun iki umur Greg <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> taun lan umur Alex <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>23</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> mula Alex <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> taun luwih tuwa tinimbang Greg. Nalika umur Greg <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Umur Alex <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Nalika umur Greg <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>35</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Umur Alex bakal <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>38</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira wae umur Greg, umur Alex bakal tansah <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> taun luwih tuwa, ta?</para><para id="eip-464">Ing basa aljabar, kita ngarani umur Greg lan umur Alex minangka <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00001">variabel</term>, dene telu minangka <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00002">konstanta</term>. Umure owah-owahan, mula umur minangka variabel. Selisih umur <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> taun antarane dheweke tansah tetep, mula selisih umur kasebut minangka konstanta.</para><para id="fs-id1633275">Ing aljabar, aksara digunakake kanggo nyatakake variabel. Upamane umur Greg dinyatakake nganggo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Kita bisa nggunakake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kanggo nyatakake umur Alex. Delengen <link target-id="fs-id2953912" />.</para>
<table id="fs-id2953912" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni limang larik lan loro kolom. Larik kapisan minangka larik sirah. Kolom kapisan duwe label ‘umur Greg’ lan kolom kapindho ‘umur Alex’. Ing sangisore kolom ‘umur Greg’ ana nilai 12, 20, lan 35; larik pungkasan isine aksara g. Ing sangisore kolom ‘umur Alex’ ana nilai 15, 23, lan 38; larik pungkasan isine g ditambah 3.">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center">Umur Greg</entry>
<entry align="center">Umur Alex</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>23</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>35</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>38</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mi>g</m:mi></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="fs-id2137950">Aksara digunakake kanggo nyatakake variabel. Aksara sing kerep dadi variabel yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<note id="fs-id2399231">
<title>Variabel lan Konstanta</title>
<para id="fs-id2203250">Variabel yaiku aksara sing nyatakake sawijining wilangan utawa besaran sing nilaine bisa owah.</para><para id="fs-id1604743">Konstanta yaiku wilangan sing nilaine tansah tetep.</para></note>
<para id="fs-id1722327">Kanggo nulis ing wujud aljabar, saliyane wilangan lan variabel kita mbutuhake sawetara simbol. Ana sawetara jinis simbol sing bakal digunakake. Ing <link document="m81243">Wilangan Cacah</link>, kita wis ngenalake simbol kanggo patang <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00003">operasi</term> operasi aritmetika dhasar: panambahan, pangurangan, ping-pingan, lan paran. Ing kene Kita bakal ngringkes operasi lan istilah kanggo asile.</para><table id="fs-id1891703" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni limang larik lan papat kolom. Larik kapisan minangka larik sirah. Kolom-kolome duwe label ‘operasi’, ‘Notasi’, ‘diwaca’, lan ‘asile yaiku’. Larik-larik sabanjure njlentrehake panambahan, pangurangan, ping-pingan, lan paran; saben-saben nuduhake notasi aljabar, cara macane, lan jeneng asile."><label />
<tgroup cols="4"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left"><emphasis effect="bold">Operasi</emphasis></entry>
<entry align="left"><emphasis effect="bold">Notasi</emphasis></entry>
<entry align="left"><emphasis effect="bold">Diwaca:</emphasis></entry>
<entry align="left"><emphasis effect="bold">Asile yaiku…</emphasis></entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Panambahan</entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>ditambah</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left">gunggung <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Pangurangan</entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>dikurangi</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left">selisih <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Ping-pingan</entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>dipingake</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left">asil ping-pingan <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Paran</entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">/</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mfrac><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:menclose notation="longdiv"><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:menclose></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> dipara <m:math><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left">asil paran <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>


</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1560745">Ing aljabar, tandha silang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> ora digunakake kanggo nyatakake ping-pingan amarga bisa njalari bingung. Apa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> ateges <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> (telu dipingake <m:math><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:math>) utawa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> (telu dipingake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>dipingake</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>)? Supaya cetha, gunakna • utawa tandha kurung kanggo nyatakake ping-pingan.</para>
<para id="fs-id1885631">Operasi kasebut ditindakake marang rong wilangan. Nalika ngowahi wujud simbol dadi tetembungan, utawa kosokbaline, gatekna tembung kaya <emphasis effect="italics">saka</emphasis> utawa <emphasis effect="italics">lan</emphasis> kanggo mbantu sampeyan ngenali rong wilangane.</para>
<list id="fs-id1969800" list-type="labeled-item"><item><emphasis effect="italics">Gunggung</emphasis> <emphasis effect="bold"><emphasis effect="italics">saka</emphasis></emphasis> <m:math><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math> <emphasis effect="bold"><emphasis effect="italics">lan</emphasis></emphasis> <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> ateges nggunggung <m:math><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math> kanthi <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:math> sing kita tulis minangka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item><emphasis effect="italics">Selisih</emphasis> <emphasis effect="bold"><emphasis effect="italics">saka</emphasis></emphasis> <m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:math> <emphasis effect="bold"><emphasis effect="italics">lan</emphasis></emphasis> <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> ateges nyuda <m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:math> kanthi <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:math> sing kita tulis minangka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item><emphasis effect="italics">Asil ping-pingan</emphasis> <emphasis effect="bold"><emphasis effect="italics">saka</emphasis></emphasis> <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math> <emphasis effect="bold"><emphasis effect="italics">lan</emphasis></emphasis> <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:math> ateges ngepingake <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math> kanthi <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:math> sing bisa kita tulis minangka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item><emphasis effect="italics">Asil paran</emphasis> <emphasis effect="bold"><emphasis effect="italics">saka</emphasis></emphasis> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <emphasis effect="bold"><emphasis effect="italics">lan</emphasis></emphasis> <m:math><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math> ateges mara <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kanthi <m:math><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:math> sing bisa kita tulis minangka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item></list><example id="fs-id4121509"><exercise id="fs-id2646360">
<problem id="fs-id1804532">
<para id="fs-id2430630">Owahana wujud aljabar dadi tetembungan:
<list id="eip-id1168469763234" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>30</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>64</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1604284">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-815" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Maneka cara nyatakake gunggung rolas lan patbelas."><label />
<tgroup cols="1"><tbody>
<row><entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> </entry> </row>
<row>
    <entry align="center"><m:math><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry align="center">12 ditambah 14</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry align="center">gunggung rolas lan patbelas</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>


</tgroup>
</table><table id="eip-653" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake maneka cara kanggo nyatakake ekspresi ping-pingan (30)(5)."><label />
<tgroup cols="1"><tbody>
<row><entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> </entry> </row>
  <row>
    <entry align="center"><m:math><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mn>30</m:mn><m:mo>)</m:mo><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry align="center">30 dipingake 5</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry align="center">asil ping-pingan telung puluh lan lima</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>



</tgroup>
</table><table id="eip-id1164753916055" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Nuduhake maneka cara kanggo nyatakake operasi matematika ‘64 dipara 8’."><label />
<tgroup cols="1"><tbody>
  <row><entry><span class="token">ⓒ</span> </entry></row>
  <row>
    <entry align="center"><m:math><m:mn>64</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry align="center">64 dipara 8</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry align="center">asil paran sewidak papat lan wolu</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>



</tgroup>
</table><table id="eip-id1164753916109" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Nuduhake maneka cara kanggo nyatakake selisih matematis antarane variabel x lan y."><label />
<tgroup cols="1"><tbody>
<row><entry><span class="token">ⓓ</span> </entry></row>
  <row>
    <entry align="center"><m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry align="center"><m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:math> dikurangi <m:math><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry align="center">selisih <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:math></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>



</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1515897" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1531302"><problem id="fs-id2205513">
<para id="fs-id1807700">Owahana wujud aljabar dadi tetembungan.
<list id="eip-id1168469668897" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.4em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.4em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>84</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mi>p</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:math></item></list></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1383680">
<list id="eip-id1168469837643" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 18 ditambah 11; gunggung wolulas lan sewelas</item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 27 dipingake 9; asil ping-pingan pitulikur lan sanga</item>

<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> 84 dipara 7; asil paran wolung puluh papat lan pitu</item>

<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <emphasis effect="italics">p</emphasis> dikurangi <emphasis effect="italics">q</emphasis>; selisih <emphasis effect="italics">p</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">q</emphasis></item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id1171103118625" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1913698"><problem id="fs-id2161871">
<para id="fs-id1171104039532">Owahana wujud aljabar dadi tetembungan.
<list id="eip-id1168468485516" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>47</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.4em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>72</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.4em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.4em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:math></item></list></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1887825">
<list id="eip-id1168465110670" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 47 dikurangi 19; selisih patang puluh pitu lan sangalas</item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 72 dipara 9; asil paran pitung puluh loro lan sanga</item>


<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <emphasis effect="italics">m</emphasis> ditambah <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis>; gunggung <emphasis effect="italics">m</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> 13 dipingake 7; asil ping-pingan telulas lan pitu</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
<para id="fs-id1370913">Nalika loro besaran nduweni nilai sing padha, kita ngarani loro-lorone padha lan nyambungake kanthi <emphasis effect="italics">tandha padha karo</emphasis>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1603053">
<title>Tandha Padha Karo</title>
<para id="fs-id1885124"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>diwaca</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>padha karo</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id2775026">Simbol <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> diarani <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00004">tandha padha karo</term>.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id2792607"><term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00005">Pertidaksamaan</term> digunakake ing aljabar kanggo mbandhingake rong besaran sing nilaine bisa beda. Garis wilangan bisa mbantu sampeyan mangerteni pertidaksamaan. Elinga yen ing garis wilangan nilai saya gedhé saka kiwa menyang tengen. Mula, yen <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> luwih gedhé tinimbang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> ateges <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> mapan ing sisih tengen <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> ing garis wilangan. kita nggunakake simbol <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>“&lt;”</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>“&gt;”</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> kanggo pertidaksamaan.</para>
<note id="fs-id2650456">
<title>Pertidaksamaan</title>
<para id="fs-id3202723"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> luwih cilik tinimbang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id2700412"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> mapan ing sisih kiwa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> ing garis wilangan</para>
<media id="fs-id1933083" alt="Gambar nuduhake garis wilangan horizontal kanthi aksara a ing sisih kiwa lan aksara b ing sisih tengene.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_001.jpg" />
</media>
<para id="fs-id2495460"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> luwih gedhé tinimbang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1379804"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> mapan ing sisih tengen <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> ing garis wilangan</para>
<media id="fs-id1467098" alt="Gambar nuduhake garis wilangan horizontal kanthi aksara b ing sisih kiwa lan aksara a ing sisih tengene.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_002.jpg" />
</media>
</note>
<para id="fs-id3242396">Ekspresi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> bisa diwaca saka kiwa menyang tengen utawa saka tengen menyang kiwa, sanajan lumrahe diwaca saka kiwa menyang tengen. Umume,</para>
<equation id="fs-id2284597" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable columnalign="left"><m:mtr columnalign="left"><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>padha karo</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo><m:mspace width="2em" /><m:mtext>Minangka tuladha,</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>padha karo</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr columnalign="left"><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>padha karo</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo><m:mspace width="2em" /><m:mtext>Minangka tuladha,</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>padha karo</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id2903489">Nalika kita nulis simbol pertidaksamaan kanthi garis ing ngisore, kaya <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> ateges <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> utawa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Kita macane <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> luwih cilik utawa padha karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Saliyane kuwi, yen tandha padha karo diwenehi garis miring, <m:math><m:mtext>≠,</m:mtext></m:math> ateges ora padha karo.</para>
<para id="fs-id1238987">Simbol-simbol pepadhan lan pertidaksamaan diringkes ing <link target-id="fs-id1778628" />.</para>
<table id="fs-id1778628" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni pitu larik lan loro kolom. Larik kapisan minangka larik sirah. Kolom kapisan duwe label ‘notasi aljabar’ lan kolom kapindho ‘diwaca’. enem larik sabanjure ngemot a padha karo b, a ora padha karo b, a luwih cilik tinimbang b, a luwih gedhé tinimbang b, a luwih cilik utawa padha karo b, sarta a luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo b, saben-saben ing notasi lan tetembungan.">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center">Notasi Aljabar</entry>
<entry align="center">Diwaca</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> padha karo <m:math><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> ora padha karo <m:math><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> luwih cilik tinimbang <m:math><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> luwih gedhé tinimbang <m:math><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> luwih cilik utawa padha karo <m:math><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>≥</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo <m:math><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<note id="fs-id2316516"><title>Simbol <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></title><para id="fs-id1508974">Simbol <m:math><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo></m:math> saben-saben nduweni sisih sing luwih cilik lan sisih sing luwih gedhé.</para>
<para id="eip-id1168265897874">sisih luwih cilik   <m:math><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo></m:math>      sisih luwih gedhé  <newline />
sisih luwih gedhé     <m:math><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo></m:math>      sisih luwih cilik</para>
<para id="fs-id2263448">Sisih simbol sing luwih cilik madhep wilangan sing luwih cilik, dene sisih sing luwih gedhé madhep wilangan sing luwih gedhé.</para>
</note><example id="fs-id1364828"><exercise id="fs-id2316251"><problem id="fs-id2199402">
<para id="fs-id2627959">Owahana wujud aljabar dadi tetembungan:
<list id="eip-id1168466395280" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>35</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1210439">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-399" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nyuguhake pertidaksamaan matematika 20 ≤ 35 sarta cara macane ing tetembungan."><label />
<tgroup cols="1"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> </entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>35</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>20 luwih cilik utawa padha karo 35</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>


</tgroup>
</table>

<table id="eip-id1164752763787" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nyuguhake pertidaksamaan matematika 11 ≠ 15 − 3 ing wujud simbol lan tetembungan."><label />
<tgroup cols="1"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> </entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>11 ora padha karo 15 dikurangi 3</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table>

<table id="eip-id1164753846062" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Nyuguhake pertidaksamaan matematika 9 &gt; 10 ÷ 2 sarta cara macane ing tetembungan."><label />
<tgroup cols="1"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓒ</span> </entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>9 luwih gedhé tinimbang 10 dipara 2</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table>

<table id="eip-id1164752824586" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Nuduhake pertidaksamaan x + 2 &lt; 10 ing notasi matematika lan tetembungan."><label />
<tgroup cols="1"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓓ</span> </entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry><m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry><m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:math> ditambah 2 luwih cilik tinimbang 10</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table>
</solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1297928" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2310743"><problem id="fs-id1205270">
<para id="fs-id2903606">Owahana wujud aljabar dadi tetembungan.
<list id="eip-id1168466011782" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2816995">
<list id="eip-id1168466395276" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> patbelas luwih cilik utawa padha karo pitulikur</item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> sangalas dikurangi loro ora padha karo wolu</item>

<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> rolas luwih gedhé tinimbang papat dipara loro</item>

<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dikurangi pitu luwih cilik tinimbang siji</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id1171104414920" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1573881"><problem id="fs-id1614444">
<para id="fs-id1171103156301">Owahana wujud aljabar dadi tetembungan.
<list id="eip-id1168469636286" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mo>≥</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>-</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1567145">
<list id="eip-id1168469636381" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> sangalas luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo limalas</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> pitu padha karo rolas dikurangi lima</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> limalas dipara telu luwih cilik tinimbang wolu</item><item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> dikurangi telu luwih gedhé tinimbang enem</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
<example id="fs-id1714381"><exercise id="fs-id2926178"><problem id="fs-id2471355">
<para id="fs-id1825021">Informasi ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_003" /> mbandhingake efisiensi bahan bakar sawetara mobil ing mile saben gallon (mpg). tulisen simbol sing pas, yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>=</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>&lt;</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>utawa</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>&gt;</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>, ing saben ekspresi kanggo mbandhingake efisiensi bahan bakar mobil-mobil kasebut.
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_003">
<media id="fs-id1495317" alt="Tabel iki nduweni rong larik lan enem kolom. Kolom kapisan minangka kolom sirah sing menehi label ‘Mobil’ lan ‘Efisiensi bahan bakar (mpg)’. Ing sisih tengene ana Prius, Mini Cooper, Toyota Corolla, Versa, lan Honda Fit sarta gambar saben model. Larik efisiensi bahan bakar sing katon ngemot 48, 27, 28, 26, lan 27; ora ana aksara variabel utawa tandha padha karo sing kacithak ing gambar.">
<image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_003_id.png" />
</media>
<caption>(kredit: modifikasi karya Bernard Goldbach, Wikimedia Commons)</caption>
</figure>
<list id="eip-id1168467200954" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> mpg Prius_____ mpg Mini Cooper</item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> mpg Versa_____ mpg Fit</item><item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> mpg Mini Cooper_____ mpg Fit</item><item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> mpg Corolla_____ mpg Versa</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> mpg Corolla_____ mpg Prius</item></list></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1215439">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-254" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Pambandhing nilai mpg Prius lan Mini Cooper sing nuduhake yen efisiensi bahan bakar Prius luwih dhuwur.">
<label /><tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> </entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry />
    <entry align="center">mpg Prius____mpg Mini Cooper</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Golekana nilaine ing tabel.</entry>
    <entry align="center">48____27</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Bandhingna.</entry>
    <entry align="center">48 &gt; 27</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry />
    <entry align="center">mpg Prius &gt; mpg Mini Cooper</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>


</tgroup>
</table>
