</table>

<table id="eip-id1164755231773" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake pambandhing saben tahap nilai mile saben gallon (mpg) Toyota Corolla lan Nissan Versa, kalebu data numerik lan asil pambandhinge."><label />
