</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table><table id="eip-id1164755231845" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki mbandhingake mpg Corolla (28) lan Prius (48), sing nuduhake efisiensi bahan bakar Prius luwih dhuwur."><label />
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
