</section><section id="fs-id1193286"><title>Nggawe Ekspresi Luwih Prasaja Nganggo Urutan Operasi</title><para id="fs-id1357642">Kita wis ngenalake akeh-akehe simbol lan notasi sing digunakake ing aljabar, nanging saiki perlu njlentrehake <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00011">urutan operasi itung</term>. Tanpa paugeran iki, sawijining ekspresi bisa ditegesi nganggo cara beda lan ngasilake nilai sing beda.</para>
<para id="fs-id1171101101203">Minangka tuladha, gatekna ekspresi ing ngisor iki:</para>
<equation id="fs-id1171101101206" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<equation id="fs-id1171103305974" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext>Sawetara murid nggawe luwih prasaja dadi 49.</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mspace width="2em" /></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mtext>Sawetara murid nggawe luwih prasaja dadi 25.</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Amarga</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>ngasilake 7.</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mspace width="2em" /></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>padha karo 49.</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mspace width="2em" /></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>49</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>Amarga</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>padha karo 21.</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>21</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>Lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>ngasilake 25.</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation><para id="fs-id1530117">Bayangna bingunge yen saben soal nduweni sawetara wangsulan bener sing beda. Ekspresi sing padha kudu ngasilake asil sing padha. Mula, para ahli matematika netepake paugeran sing diarani urutan operasi, yaiku paugeran kanggo ngurutake panyederhanaan saben bagean ekspresi.</para>
<note id="fs-id1715524"><title>Urutan Operasi Itung</title><para id="fs-id2750738">Nalika nggawe ekspresi matematika luwih prasaja, tindakna operasi miturut urutan ing ngisor iki:</para>
<para id="fs-id1834652">1. <emphasis effect="bold">T</emphasis>andha Kurung lan Simbol Panglumpukan Liyane</para>
<list id="fs-id1171104029952" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Gawea luwih prasaja kabeh ekspresi ing njero tandha kurung utawa simbol panglumpukan liyane, diwiwiti saka tandha kurung sing paling njero.</item>
</list>
<para id="fs-id1570796">2. <emphasis effect="bold">E</emphasis>ksponen</para>
<list id="fs-id1171104407077" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Gawea kabeh ekspresi sing ngemot eksponen dadi luwih prasaja.</item>
</list>
<para id="fs-id1894922">3. <emphasis effect="bold">P</emphasis>ing-pingan lan <emphasis effect="bold">P</emphasis>aran</para>
<list id="fs-id1171103140103" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Tindakna kabeh ping-pingan lan paran kanthi urut saka kiwa menyang tengen. Loro operasi iki nduweni prioritas sing padha.</item>
</list>
<para id="fs-id3402451">4. <emphasis effect="bold">P</emphasis>anambahan lan <emphasis effect="bold">P</emphasis>angurangan</para>
<list id="fs-id1171104002792" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Tindakna kabeh panambahan lan pangurangan kanthi urut saka kiwa menyang tengen. Loro operasi iki nduweni prioritas sing padha.</item>
</list>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1269648">Murid kerep takon, “kepriye cara ngelingi urutane?” elinga papat tahap ing ngisor iki kanthi eksplisit: <emphasis effect="bold">tandha kurung</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="bold">eksponen</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="bold">ping-pingan</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="bold">paran</emphasis>, banjur <emphasis effect="bold">panambahan</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="bold">pangurangan</emphasis>. kanggo operasi ing tahap sing padha, garapen saka kiwa menyang tengen.</para>
<table id="fs-id1786633" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni limang larik lan loro kolom. Larik kapisan mbentang rong kolom lan isine irah-irahan ‘Urutan Operasi’. Papat larik sabanjure nyantumake tahap lan operasine kanthi urut: tahap 1, tandha kurung lan simbol panglumpukan; tahap 2, eksponen; tahap 3, ping-pingan lan paran saka kiwa menyang tengen; sarta tahap 4, panambahan lan pangurangan saka kiwa menyang tengen.">
<label />
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" namest="c1" nameend="c2"><emphasis effect="bold">Urutan Operasi Itung</emphasis></entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left"><emphasis effect="bold">Tahap 1</emphasis></entry>
<entry align="left"><emphasis effect="bold">T</emphasis>andha kurung lan simbol panglumpukan</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left"><emphasis effect="bold">Tahap 2</emphasis></entry>
<entry align="left"><emphasis effect="bold">E</emphasis>ksponen</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left"><emphasis effect="bold">Tahap</emphasis> <emphasis effect="bold">3</emphasis></entry>
<entry align="left"><emphasis effect="bold">P</emphasis>ing-pingan lan <emphasis effect="bold">P</emphasis>aran, saka kiwa menyang tengen</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left"><emphasis effect="bold">Tahap</emphasis> <emphasis effect="bold">4</emphasis></entry>
<entry align="left"><emphasis effect="bold">P</emphasis>anambahan lan <emphasis effect="bold">P</emphasis>angurangan, saka kiwa menyang tengen</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="fs-id1785127"><emphasis effect="bold">Ping-pingan</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="bold">paran</emphasis> ana ing tahap sing padha amarga loro-lorone nduweni prioritas sing padha. kita ora tansah nggarap <emphasis effect="bold">ping-pingan</emphasis> sadurunge <emphasis effect="bold">paran</emphasis> utawa kosokbaline. Garapen loro-lorone kanthi urut saka kiwa menyang tengen.</para>
<para id="fs-id1389767">Mangkono uga, <emphasis effect="bold">panambahan</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="bold">pangurangan</emphasis> nduweni prioritas sing padha. amarga kuwi, garapen <emphasis effect="bold">panambahan</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="bold">pangurangan</emphasis> kanthi urut saka kiwa menyang tengen.</para>

<note id="eip-313" class="manipulative-math">Kagiyatan Matematika Manipulatif dolanan 24 menehi sampeyan gladhen nggunakake urutan operasi.</note><example id="fs-id1949613"><exercise id="fs-id1238361">
<problem id="fs-id2588260">
<para id="fs-id1270576">Gawea luwih prasaja ekspresi-ekspresi ing ngisor iki:

<list id="eip-id1168467381591" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1136960">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>

<table id="eip-id1164750479370" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Tabel iki nuduhake ekspresi papat ditambah telu ping pitu. Larik sabanjure takon apa ana tandha kurung ing ekspresi; wangsulane ora. Larik sawise kuwi takon apa ana eksponen; wangsulane ora. Larik sabanjure takon apa ana ping-pingan utawa paran; wangsulane ya. Pingna luwih dhisik, mula ekspresi dadi papat ditambah selikur. Operasi pungkasan yaiku panambahan. Gunggungen papat lan selikur kanggo entuk salawé."><label />
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> </entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry />
    <entry><media id="eip-id1164750479401" alt="Ekspresi matematika papat ditambah telu ping pitu, ditulis minangka 4 + 3 · 7."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_011_img-01.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis>tandha</emphasis> kurung? ora.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis>e</emphasis>ksponen? ora.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis>p</emphasis>ing-pingan utawa <emphasis>p</emphasis>aran? ya.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake luwih dhisik.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1164754094653" alt="Gambar nuduhake ekspresi matematika 4 + 3 · 7. Angka 3 lan 7 awarna abang, dene angka 4 lan tandha tambah awarna ireng."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_011_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gunggungen.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1164754094670" alt="Ekspresi matematika 4 + 21 ditampilake kanthi latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_011_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry />
    <entry><media id="eip-id1164754094685" alt="Angka 25 ditampilake kanthi cetha ing latar putih polos."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_011_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>



</tgroup>
</table>
<table id="eip-id1164754514704" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Tabel iki nuduhake ekspresi papat ditambah telu ing njero tandha kurung, banjur dipingake pitu. Apa ana tandha kurung? ya; gawea luwih prasaja isi tandha kurung kanthi nggunggung papat lan telu mula dipikolehi pitu. Ekspresi saiki dadi pitu ping pitu. Apa ana eksponen? ora. Apa ana ping-pingan utawa paran? ya; pingna pitu kanthi pitu kanggo entuk patang puluh sanga."><label />
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> </entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry />
    <entry><media id="eip-id1164754514734" alt="Ekspresi matematika (4 + 3) dipingake 7, kanthi panambahan ana ing njero tandha kurung."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_012_img-01.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis>tandha</emphasis> kurung? ya.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1164754514754" alt="Ekspresi matematika (4 + 3) · 7, kanthi angka 4 lan 3 sarta tandha tambah awarna abang ing njero tandha kurung abang, diterusake titik ping-pingan lan angka 7 awarna ireng."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_012_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gawea luwih prasaja bagean ing njero tandha kurung.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1164754514771" alt="Gambar nuduhake ekspresi numerik klawu tuwa ing latar putih: angka pitu ing njero tandha kurung langsung diterusake angka pitu liyane, yaiku (7)7."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_012_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis>e</emphasis>ksponen? ora.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis>p</emphasis>ing-pingan utawa <emphasis>p</emphasis>aran? ya.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1164754514814" alt="Angka 49 ditampilake kanthi cetha ing tengah gambar ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_012_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>


</tgroup>
</table>
</solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id2399434" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1020408"><problem id="fs-id1496028">
<para id="fs-id2132962">Gawea luwih prasaja ekspresi-ekspresi ing ngisor iki:
<list id="eip-id1168467165875" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.4em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1732185">
<list id="eip-id1168468411163" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 2 </item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span>  14</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id1171104389195" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2478161"><problem id="fs-id1622271">
<para id="fs-id1171100608975">Gawea luwih prasaja ekspresi-ekspresi ing ngisor iki:
<list id="eip-id1168468535071" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.4em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2265132">
<list id="eip-id1168467599044" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 35</item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 99</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
<example id="fs-id1201946"><exercise id="fs-id1956499"><problem id="fs-id3340653">
<para id="fs-id1714375">Gawea luwih prasaja: <list id="eip-id1168468508209" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1231784">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>



<table id="eip-id1164754213884" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Tabel iki nuduhake ekspresi wolulas dipara sanga banjur dipingake loro. Apa ana tandha kurung? ora. Apa ana eksponen? ora. Apa ana ping-pingan utawa paran? ya, loro-lorone ana. Garapen ping-pingan lan paran saka kiwa menyang tengen, dadi paranen luwih dhisik. wolulas dipara sanga ngasilake loro. Ekspresi saiki dadi loro ping loro. Operasi pungkasan yaiku ping-pingan. Loro ping loro ngasilake papat."><label />
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> </entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry />
    <entry><media id="eip-id1164754213914" alt="Ekspresi matematika nuduhake angka 18, 9, lan 2 sing dipisahake dening tandha paran lan titik ping-pingan, yaiku 18 ÷ 9 · 2."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_013_img-01.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis>tandha</emphasis> kurung? ora.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis>e</emphasis>ksponen? ora.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis>p</emphasis>ing-pingan utawa <emphasis>p</emphasis>aran? ya.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingna lan paranen saka kiwa menyang tengen. paranen.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1164752720013" alt="Gambar nuduhake ekspresi 2 · 2: angka 2 kapisan awarna abang, diterusake titik ping-pingan lan angka 2 kapindho awarna ireng ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_013_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1164752720030" alt="Angka papat."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_013_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table>
<table id="eip-id1164752720001" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Tabel iki nuduhake ekspresi wolulas ping sanga banjur dipara loro. Apa ana tandha kurung? ora. Apa ana eksponen? ora. Apa ana ping-pingan utawa paran? ya, loro-lorone ana. Garapen ping-pingan lan paran saka kiwa menyang tengen, dadi pingna luwih dhisik. Wolulas ping sanga ngasilake satus sewidak loro. Ekspresi saiki dadi satus sewidak loro dipara loro. Operasi pungkasan yaiku paran. Satus sewidak loro dipara loro ngasilake wolung puluh siji."><label />
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> </entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry />
    <entry><media id="eip-id1164752720032" alt="Ekspresi matematika 18 · 9 ÷ 2 ditampilake: wolulas dipingake sanga, banjur asile dipara loro. Raster iki mung nuduhake ekspresi kasebut; asil 81 ditampilake ing gambar sabanjure."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_014_img-01.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis>tandha</emphasis> kurung? ora.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis>e</emphasis>ksponen? ora.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Apa ana <emphasis>p</emphasis>ing-pingan utawa <emphasis>p</emphasis>aran? ya.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingna lan paranen saka kiwa menyang tengen.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1164752720096" alt="Ekspresi matematika 162 ÷ 2 ditampilake kanthi angka 162 awarna abang sarta tandha paran lan angka 2 awarna ireng ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_014_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Paranen.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1164752720113" alt="Angka 81 ditampilake nganggo tulisan serif ireng biasa ing latar putih polos."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_02_01_014_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>









</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id2241355" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2877115">
<problem id="fs-id2626286">
<para id="fs-id1632084">Gawea luwih prasaja:</para>
<para id="fs-id2626288"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>42</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
